  "Seed for the FUT Champions Weekend League reward ranks (owner design 2026-10-03, todo.md section 2). The server keeps these ranks in the",
  "champions_reward_ranks, rewards and reward_lines tables: a fresh database is filled from this file at start-up; an upgraded one converts the",
  "ranks its rules held. From then on they change through the operator panel (Modes, Champions) and content changesets, not this file.",
  "tierLevel: the rank's stable id. wins: a rank by wins out of seasons.json weekendLeague.maxMatches, [low, high]; together they cover 0 to",
  "maxMatches exactly once, at most 12 (FIFA's Elite 1 to Bronze 3). positions: a Top 25 band by leaderboard position, [low, high], running on",
  "Six leaderboard bands at most (FIFA numbers them 1-6, per the client service; not yet checked in game). Owner, 2026-10-03: fixed Top 25 bands at 1, 2-5, 6-10, 11-15, 16-20 and 21-25; each keeps the corresponding old band reward.",
  "from position 1; every ranked player in these positions with the wins rules/champions_rewards.json minWinsForTop sets (from minWinsForTopFromEvent) receives the band reward.",
  "reward: coins, FUT Champions Points (capped at fcPointsCap in total), XP (not paid by Champions) and lines. A line is a pack (packId) with a",
  "count and its own untradeable choice, which is what the club receives. 550/552/553 are untradeable red FUT Champions picks and 551 Silver",
  "2/3's 1 of 2, max 84; 540, 541 and the picks draw from fixed TOTW 1-3 reward pools."
